{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Japanese Horror \u00d7 Monsters \u00d7 Escape \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhere\u2019s my mom\u2026?\u201d<br>Yuni, the young protagonist, wakes up in a strange otherworld\u2014<br>a place she has never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cNiraya of \u25a0\u25a0\u201d</strong> is a Japanese-style horror adventure where a powerless child must flee from monstrous beings and fight to return home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Year 2000, late summer \u2014</strong><br>During a ritual held at a small temple in rural Japan, Yuni suddenly loses consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wakes up inside a cold refrigerator.<br>Her mother is nowhere to be found\u2014<br>and the outside world has completely transformed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lantern-lined tunnels, temple-like structures\u2014<br>and uncanny, twisted creatures roaming the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Yuni can do is move forward,<br>dodging attacks and fleeing from the monsters that hunt her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longing once more for her mother\u2019s warmth\u2014<br>a child\u2019s desperate escape from the otherworld begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/01217fe79f71cccd406f7922611dfb0b.poster.avif?t=1765182884\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/01217fe79f71cccd406f7922611dfb0b.webm?t=1765182884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A truth that slowly reveals itself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and collect notes to uncover why Yuni was taken into this realm and the deeper mysteries behind her situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf The terror of being unable to fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuni has <strong>no means of combat</strong>.<br>Sense murderous intent, hide, run, and narrowly avoid attacks to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Tension born from stamina management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running drains stamina and leaves Yuni unable to move.<br>Reckless sprinting will quickly lead to being cornered.<br>Manage stamina carefully to escape your pursuers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/8bd2bda34aeb2f1c409edf94c9e2e2b2.poster.avif?t=1765182884\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/8bd2bda34aeb2f1c409edf94c9e2e2b2.webm?t=1765182884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A Japanese otherworld inspired by medieval Buddhist imagery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Buddha statues, massive mandalas, and sudden modern road signs\u2014<br>a world that feels structured yet profoundly unnatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/bf4da65d7eae28f5b8abb6eb5b12ff1b.poster.avif?t=1765182884\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/bf4da65d7eae28f5b8abb6eb5b12ff1b.webm?t=1765182884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A vast and atmospheric world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A temple field filled with red spider lilies; rows of spinning pinwheels\u2014<br>Explore eerie yet beautiful environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/7ff88180cfbd93286d11034ed3705405.poster.avif?t=1765182884\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/extras/7ff88180cfbd93286d11034ed3705405.webm?t=1765182884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approx. 6\u20138 hours</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet, creeping horror / Tense chases / Japanese-style horror / Isolation / Pursuit</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Where am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/d67a4ca5293708014a654c7c041e4898d0b14e68.jpg"},{"name":"Phone Mom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/fa7156f3c532fd3957d634ee606bc37c98a2d83e.jpg"},{"name":"To the Sanmon Gate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/d128ccd71212436f18c815d0dff7fb0010f3c099.jpg"},{"name":"Hello?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/c02dbd75b157fb8b40c0ec436a97241468c1c37e.jpg"},{"name":"Is it Gone?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/06f4df090fa35b8ab2f92b05d293970de3216607.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/567d92ef23f6949bd5af75c0d62fd05c7082aa8f.jpg"},{"name":"Look at the Size of That Thing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/8ac2bbe36529a3b9b0e843fd141a7dc06a5f28f0.jpg"},{"name":"A Monster!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/4cfc8f42da84f2e30c2f9c4087bfeb94f3a43dbe.jpg"},{"name":"Burst Apart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/7b5b99156b5689bfff1778fbbea1441cff10a19c.jpg"},{"name":"Beware the Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034350/7830674b157997b155b3bee3cfa236dc627b1db6.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3034350?t=1765182884","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3034350?t=1765182884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/10441b02394284f03489ca7db619ae1408c8fb40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765182884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034350/10441b02394284f03489ca7db619ae1408c8fb40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765182884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The early cinematic sequences in the game contain excessive violence."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3678610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Japanese Horror \u00d7 Monsters \u00d7 Escape \u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhere\u2019s my mom\u2026?\u201d<br>Yuni, the young protagonist, wakes up in a strange otherworld\u2014<br>a place she has never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u